{"schema_version":2,"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","events":[{"id":"hechang-e-fd18b596646627718977","title":"关羽围樊赵俨议待援与徐晃协力解围","accounts":[{"id":"hechang-a-fd18b596646627718977","label":"正文","text":"关羽围樊赵俨议待援与徐晃协力解围","evidence":["hechang-q-787bcd8c3c292058d43a"]}],"participants":[{"person":"wudi-p0172","role":"围樊后退","evidence":["hechang-q-787bcd8c3c292058d43a"]},{"person":"cao-ren","role":"被围","evidence":["hechang-q-787bcd8c3c292058d43a"]},{"person":"shaodi-p0016","role":"参谋解围","evidence":["hechang-q-787bcd8c3c292058d43a"]},{"person":"wudi-p0180","role":"率救军","evidence":["hechang-q-787bcd8c3c292058d43a"]},{"person":"sun-quan","role":"袭辎重","evidence":["hechang-q-787bcd8c3c292058d43a"]}],"place":null,"time":{"label":"年代未详","precision":"undated","basis":"未审定公元年，不从相邻段落推算。","evidence":["hechang-q-787bcd8c3c292058d43a"]},"ordering_evidence":"hechang-q-787bcd8c3c292058d43a","order":4795}],"persons":[{"id":"cao-ren","name":"曹仁","facts":[],"aliases":[]},{"id":"shaodi-p0016","name":"赵俨","facts":[],"aliases":[]},{"id":"sun-quan","name":"孙权","facts":[],"aliases":[]},{"id":"wudi-p0172","name":"关羽","facts":[],"aliases":[]},{"id":"wudi-p0180","name":"徐晃","facts":[],"aliases":[]}],"evidence":[{"id":"hechang-q-787bcd8c3c292058d43a","section":"chapter-023","block":"b-3ad4017382a4a7ddbc8a","layer":"original","quote":"关羽围征南将军曹仁于樊〖1〗。俨以议郎参仁军事，南行，（迁）〔与〕平寇将军徐晃俱前〖2〗。既到，羽围仁遂坚；余救兵未到，晃所督不足解围；而诸将（呵）〔呼〕责晃促救〖3〗。俨谓诸将曰：“今贼围素固，水潦犹盛。我徒卒单少，而仁隔绝不得同力，此举适所以弊内外耳。当今不若前军逼围〖4〗，遣谍通仁；使知外救，以励将士。计北军不过十日〖5〗，尚足坚守；然后表里俱发，破贼必矣。如有缓救之戮〖6〗，余为诸（军）〔君〕当之！”诸将皆喜，便作地道， 〔射〕 箭飞书与仁；消息数通，北军亦至，并势大战。羽军既退，舟船犹据沔水〖7〗，襄阳隔绝不通〖8〗；而孙权袭取羽辎重，羽闻之，即走南还。","section_title":"和常杨杜赵裴传第二十三","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0052.xhtml","index":306,"anchor":null},"note_id":null,"start":0,"end":285}],"profiles":{},"directory_counts":{}}
